{"id":"b88e49b368748c86","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-ideal-completeness.md","title":"Ideal Completeness Theorem","display":"thm-ideal-completeness — Ideal Completeness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ideal-completeness","aliases":["58-thm-ideal-completeness"],"display":"thm-ideal-completeness — Ideal Completeness Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ideal-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ideal-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ideal-completeness — Ideal Completeness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal\">../batch05/58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (base set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (ideal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}completeness}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\to\\Biggl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,I)\n\\to \\bigcup_{\\xi\\in\\lambda}f(\\xi)\\in I\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in I\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}completeness}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\to\\Biggl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,I)\n\\to \\bigcup_{\\xi\\in\\lambda}f(\\xi)\\in I\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in I\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two displayed closure formulations—indexed sequences and arbitrary small subfamilies—are equivalent in ZFC.</li>\n<li>For regular uncountable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, the nonstationary ideal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NS}_{\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{NS}_{\\kappa}\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}completeness}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\to\\Biggl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,I)\n\\to \\bigcup_{\\xi\\in\\lambda}f(\\xi)\\in I\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathcal A|<\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in I\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NS}_{\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1288,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4216","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-ideal-completeness.md|58-thm-ideal-completeness]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751"]}